  {
   "text": "The penicillin allergy is now recorded once for Rosa Delgado (born 1979-06-14). When I looked, no allergy was on file for her, so I created the record.\n\n- **Patient:** the only Rosa Delgado in the system, Patient/31bbef8f-2c7f-4a8d-bf0b-dd9c72daf7ce.\n- **Record contents:** code 91936005 on http://snomed.info/sct, criticality high, clinical status active, and verification status confirmed.\n- **Display field:** the record also carries a display value of \"91936005\" on the code, which the app added when I corrected a wrong code on the first save. I did not remove it.\n- **Duplicates:** the AllergyIntolerance list now shows exactly one record.\n\nThe first save came out with the wrong code (294505008), so I edited the same record to fix it. The search listings in the app were slow and sometimes showed \"No results\" until a page reload, so I rechecked the allergy list after reloading.\n\nRESULT: DONE AllergyIntolerance/41ed8646-6c0f-47b2-b246-3c5196ef32d2",
